{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1829,
    "dDurationMs": 3141,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Have you ever noticed how badly people behave\nwhen they are collecting their luggage at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4970,
    "dDurationMs": 1030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the airport?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6000,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean they all cluster right up against the\ncarousel so people behind them can’t see"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10020,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their bags."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11020,
    "dDurationMs": 3489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then when you do spot your bag, you have\nto push through all the other passengers to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14509,
    "dDurationMs": 4071,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "collect it and usually bump into them as you\nare grabbing your bag off the carousel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18580,
    "dDurationMs": 1959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why is it that people behave so badly?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20539,
    "dDurationMs": 3931,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It doesn’t seem to matter which airport\nyou go to anywhere in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24470,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem is the same."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26080,
    "dDurationMs": 4250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this problem, believe it or not, is related\nto why trees are tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30330,
    "dDurationMs": 1490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Go with me on this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31820,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So why are trees this tall?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33800,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean some of them are over 115 meters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35440,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are the largest organisms on the planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38600,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you might think that they are this tall\nso that they can capture sunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42160,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to a degree that is true."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44110,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But anyone who has ever walked through a mature\nforest knows that the lower part of a tree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47900,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has basically no branches and leaves."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50330,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that makes sense, because not enough light\nfilters down through the top most branches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53870,
    "dDurationMs": 3660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make it worth having sun capturing apparatus\ndown here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57530,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over millennia trees have evolved to put their\nenergy where it yields returns, that is, in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 61580,
    "dDurationMs": 2759,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the canopy and not where it doesn’t."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64339,
    "dDurationMs": 4331,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this then begs the question: Why put all\nthis energy into building a trunk that is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68670,
    "dDurationMs": 4570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10 or 20 meters if you are never intending\nto use this vertical space to capture sunlight?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73240,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it costs energy to make this trunk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75850,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus it makes it harder to transport water\nfrom the roots up to the topmost branches"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79930,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it makes the tree more susceptible to\nwater stress."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82870,
    "dDurationMs": 5340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it is in every individual tree’s best\ninterest to be shorter, to not have this gigantic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88210,
    "dDurationMs": 5930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trunk and to use the conserved energy to improve\nits seeds and its branches, to put its energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94140,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where it pays a return."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96140,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, of course, if there was a mutation that\nallowed a tree to do this, you know what would"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99970,
    "dDurationMs": 1090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "happen to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101060,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a forest surrounded by all these taller\ntrees, it would be shaded from the sun and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105120,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it would wither and die."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107570,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what if all of the trees developed the\nsame mutation?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111510,
    "dDurationMs": 5580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if they all created a friendship pact,\na forest of friendship in which everyone agreed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117090,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not to grow such a big trunk, to star the\nleaves right at the ground?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121130,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that would mean every individual tree\nwould be better off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125570,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The trouble is this solution is not stable,\nbecause any tiny mutation that results in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130340,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a tree that is slightly taller would advantage\nthat tree."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133450,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would be able to capture more light and\nit would shade its neighbors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136490,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so pretty soon it would have more offspring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139150,
    "dDurationMs": 2330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It would come to dominate the forest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141480,
    "dDurationMs": 4990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then any additional mutation down then\nline would result in even taller trees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146470,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is how trees got so tall."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148950,
    "dDurationMs": 6140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, they would keep getting taller until\nthe cost of going one more foot is exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155090,
    "dDurationMs": 3890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "equal to benefits of collecting that additional\nsunlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158980,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that is why trees are as tall as they\nare today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160930,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, it is not an optimal solution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162750,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is not like these trees have the best use\nof their energy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166680,
    "dDurationMs": 1910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it is the one that is stable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168590,
    "dDurationMs": 5070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the point is: Although it is in every tree’s\nbest interest to be a part of this forest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173660,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of friendship, it will never work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176930,
    "dDurationMs": 4610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It will never last, because any individual\nwho gets a little bit taller is going to ruin"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181540,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it for everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 183160,
    "dDurationMs": 2409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it is the very same thing when you go\nto collect your bags."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185569,
    "dDurationMs": 4281,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, if everyone could agree to stand a\ncouple of meters away from the carousel, everyone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189850,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have a good view of their bags and be\nable to easily step forward and collect their"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193130,
    "dDurationMs": 1000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "luggage."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 194130,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, of course, one person standing forward\nis going to block the view of behind them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197770,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So everyone is going to rush forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199340,
    "dDurationMs": 3229,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is an unstable solution, just like a forest\nof friendship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202569,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 203739,
    "dDurationMs": 4041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next time you are frustrated collecting your\nbags at the airport, remember."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207780,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trees know just how you feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213960,
    "dDurationMs": 11240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I have summarized the whole problem for\nyou here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225200,
    "dDurationMs": 310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you ready?"
    } ]
  } ]
}
